# Loading Spinner

Use the shared blade spinner for **all** loading states in the web app.

## Components

- `Spinner` — `@/components/ui/spinner` (inline / centered)
- `PageLoader` — full-viewport centered loader (portal shells, auth Suspense, route loading)

## Rules

- Do **not** invent new spinners (`animate-spin`, text-only “Loading…”, custom CSS loaders)
- Prefer `<PageLoader label="…" />` for full-page waits
- Prefer `<Spinner />` or `<Spinner className="center" />` for inline / overlay waits
- CSS lives in `globals.css` (`.spinner`, `.spinner-blade`, `@keyframes spinner-fade9234`)
- Credit: Uiverse.io by mrhyddenn
